@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — Patterns across logical component roles
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

component "Public command entry" as E
component "Use-case facade" as F
component "Domain / factory" as D
interface "Required narrow ports" as P
component "Persistence / provider adapters" as A
E --> F
F --> D
F --> P
A ..|> P
note bottom of A
 Examples summarize different operations.
 External dispatch is not an implicit publication step.
end note

@enduml
